        <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-indigo-100">Monitor system components, test controlled failures and observe recovery in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div id="overall" class="w-fit rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white">Connecting...</div>
    </div>
    <p class="relative mt-5 text-xs text-indigo-100/80">Live monitoring refreshes every 2 seconds. Chaos controls are intended for local demonstrations.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="autoHealingBanner" class="soft-card mt-6 hidden rounded-2xl border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 p-5" role="status" aria-live="polite">
