        <b class="block text-sm text-slate-800">4. Crash App Process (PM2 Demo)</b>
        <small class="mt-1 block leading-5 text-slate-500">Only use when PM2 is managing ResultShield.</small>
      </button>

    </div>

    <p id="chaosMessage" class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-800" aria-live="polite">Ready for a test.</p>

